# Claude Code worktrees -- isolated checkouts of this repo, never part of a commit.
# Note .claude/agents/ IS tracked, so this must not be a blanket .claude/ ignore.
.claude/worktrees/

# Stripe agent skills, installed by `stripe agent setup`.
#
# Vendor documentation (~450K across 32 SKILL.md files) fetched from
# docs.stripe.com, not source. Regenerate with `stripe agent setup` rather than
# carrying a copy that silently goes stale against Stripe's live docs.
#
# skills-lock.json pins the content hashes, so it is ignored alongside them --
# a lock file for content the repo does not hold is a claim it cannot check.
.agents/
skills-lock.json

